{title: 208 - There'll Be No Dark Valley}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #208 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: Eb}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 208}
{meta: category Jesus Christ - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Cm/G]There'll be [Eb/Bb]no [Gm]dark [Eb]valley when Jesus comes,
[Eb/G]There'll be no dark valley [Bb]when [Cm/G]Jesus [Gm]comes,
[Eb]There'll [Cm/Eb]be [Eb]no dark valley when Jesus comes,
[Fm/Ab]To [Cm/G]gather [Gm]His loved ones home.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Refrain}
[Gm/Bb]To gather [Bb7]His [Eb]loved [Gm]ones home,
[Am]To gather [Bb]His [Bb7/Ab]loved ones [Eb/G]home.
[Fm]There'll be [Gm]no [Cm/G]dark [Eb]valleys when Jesus comes,
[Bb]To gather [Eb/Bb]His loved ones [Cm/G]home.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Cm/G]There'll be [Eb/Bb]no [Gm]more [Eb]sorrow when Jesus comes,
[Eb/G]There'll be no more sorrow [Bb]when [Cm/G]Jesus [Gm]comes,
[Eb]There'll [Cm/Eb]be a [Eb]happy tomorrow when Jesus comes,
[Fm/Ab]To [Cm/G]gather [Gm]His loved ones home.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[Cm/G]There'll be [Eb/Bb]songs [Gm]of [Eb]greeting when Jesus comes,
[Eb/G]There'll be songs of greeting [Bb]when [Cm/G]Jesus [Gm]comes,
[Eb]There'll [Cm/Eb]be [Eb]songs of greeting when Jesus comes,
[Fm/Ab]To [Cm/G]gather [Gm]His loved ones home.
{end_of_verse}
